@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@userId = 1

### Portfolio antes de operar
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio

### Compra MARKET por cantidad (modifica el saldo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 2
}

### Compra LIMIT por monto (reserva pesos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "price": "900.00",
  "amount": "2000.00"
}

### Venta MARKET
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1
}

### Ingreso de pesos
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 66,
  "side": "CASH_IN",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": "1000.00"
}

### Retiro de pesos
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instrumentId": 66,
  "side": "CASH_OUT",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 500
}

### Cancelar una orden NEW propia (reemplazar orderId por el id devuelto al crearla)
@orderId = 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
